SCOPE OF THIS LICENSE

This MIT license applies to the Colors World **colour engine** only — that is,
every file in this directory (`src/lib/color-engine/`), including its tests.

The colour engine is deliberately carved out of the application's licence and
released under permissive terms so that anyone — including commercial users —
can depend on, embed, fork, and build upon the colour mathematics without
restriction.

The rest of the Colors World application, outside this directory, remains under
the PolyForm Noncommercial License 1.0.0. See the LICENSE file at the
repository root.

If you are unsure which licence applies to a given file: if its path starts
with `src/lib/color-engine/`, it is MIT. Otherwise it is PolyForm
Noncommercial.
